        "TileImage": "$($repository 92c028a9-a72b-49bc-996b-194b8ddb795d).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Hokkaido\r\rYour targets consists of controversial furries, or... at least we call them as in other term, &quot;Zoophiles&quot;. These creators and vloggers have been making contents and arts that are quite questionable and inappropriate. Our clients, a group of Furries, want their precious community clean and fresh as possible from any major contents by the innappropriate zoophilists. The targets will be staying at GAMA as patients for surgeries. But the hospital is active, so expect security.",
